  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Amadeus Life",
      "text": "<img src=\"assets/market-icon.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Amadeus life logo\">\n\n[简体中文](README.zh-CN.md) · [Detailed configuration](REFERENCE.md) · [Issues](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/amadeus-life/issues)\n\nWorkspace-level autonomous activity, intentions and wake budgets.\n\nTarget package: **`@fg-lab/amadeus-life@1.2.1`**. Tested runtime baseline: official DSH Desktop **0.2.1-rc.3**. MIT licensed."
    },
    {
      "section": "Release status",
      "text": "**1.2.1 is published:** [GitHub Release](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/amadeus-life/releases/tag/v1.2.1) · [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fg-lab/amadeus-life). Install the pinned version and verify the release checksum. Later main changes do not change this immutable archive. See [publishing policy](docs/PUBLISHING.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "What you can do",
      "text": "- Track intentions and completed activity across a bound Workspace.\n- Define controlled wake rules with budgets, rate limits and execution boundaries; inspect activity history before enabling delivery.\n- Recognize trusted ordinary and QQ Session identities, including supported legacy IDs, without taking over QQ's immediate conversation loop.\n- Configure rules and inspect state in the plugin's dedicated native DSH settings panels."
    },
    {
      "section": "What you can do",
      "text": "Example: record a follow-up intention and set a bounded wake rule for an authorized Workspace. Review delivery state and budget use in the activity view.\n\nLife is a scheduler, not a separate language model. External actions still require the appropriate tools and authorization. Optional QQ, Memory, State and Persona integrations do not grant additional permissions. Keep wake delivery disabled until rules and targets are reviewed."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install and configure",
      "text": "Install the prebuilt `.tgz` with the official DSH plugin manager into your selected Profile. No local source build is required. Follow [installation instructions](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md); do not copy configuration into a running Profile by hand.\n\nUse native DSH settings to bind a Workspace, configure rules and budgets, then explicitly enable wake delivery.\n\nThe other Amadeus plugins are optional. Install only the integrations you need."
    },
    {
      "section": "Interface",
      "text": "This is a recorded interface screenshot, not evidence that every real platform capability passed the current release gate. See the detailed reference and verification reports for limitations."
    },
    {
      "section": "Upgrade and recovery",
      "text": "Back up user data before upgrading. Code, persistent user data and recovery backups are separate. Disable stops functionality; uninstall is intended to retain external data. Restoring old code alone does not reverse a database migration.\n\n- [Upgrade policy](docs/UPGRADE_POLICY.md)\n- [Data migration and recovery](docs/DATA_MIGRATION.md)\n- [Release checklist](docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md)\n- [Full configuration and limitations](REFERENCE.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Ecosystem and license",
      "text": "[Amadeus project](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/Amadeus-dsh) · [MIT license](LICENSE)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Amadeus Life",
      "text": "<img src=\"assets/market-icon.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Amadeus life logo\">\n\n[English](README.md) · [详细配置参考](REFERENCE.md)\n\n工作区级自主活动、意图与唤醒预算。\n\n目标发行包：**`@fg-lab/amadeus-life@1.2.1`**。已验证的官方 DSH Desktop 基线：**0.2.1-rc.3**。许可证：MIT。"
    },
    {
      "section": "当前发行状态",
      "text": "已发布 **1.2.1**：[GitHub Release](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/amadeus-life/releases/tag/v1.2.1) · [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@fg-lab/amadeus-life)。请安装固定版本；发行包校验值见 Release。后续源码修改不代表该版本安装包发生变化。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能帮你做什么",
      "text": "- 在绑定的工作区中保存意图与活动记录，追踪计划和已完成的事情。\n- 设置受预算、限流和执行边界约束的唤醒规则，在启用投递前检查活动历史。\n- 识别可信普通会话和 QQ 会话，包括支持的旧 Session ID；不接管 QQ 即时连续聊天。\n- 在专属 DSH 原生设置面板中管理规则、查看状态与历史。\n\n示例：记录待跟进意图，为已授权工作区设置有预算上限的唤醒规则，再检查活动页中的投递结果与预算消耗。\n\nLife 是调度插件，不是独立大模型。外部操作仍需对应工具和授权；与其他四插件的可选联动不会额外授予权限。规则和目标确认前应保持唤醒投递关闭。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装与首次配置",
      "text": "使用官方 DSH 插件管理器将预构建 `.tgz` 安装到所需 Profile，无需手工构建源码。按[安装说明](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md)操作，不要手工改写正在运行的 Profile。\n\n在 DSH 原生设置中绑定工作区、配置规则与预算，再显式启用唤醒投递。\n\n其他 Amadeus 插件均为可选联动，按需要分别安装。"
    },
    {
      "section": "界面",
      "text": "截图展示已有界面，不表示本轮所有真实平台能力均已通过。具体限制请阅读配置参考和验收报告。"
    },
    {
      "section": "升级与回滚",
      "text": "升级前备份用户数据。程序、持久数据和恢复备份分开保存。禁用停止功能；卸载默认保留外部数据。回退旧程序不能自动撤销数据库迁移。\n\n- [升级政策](docs/UPGRADE_POLICY.md)\n- [数据迁移与恢复](docs/DATA_MIGRATION.md)\n- [发行检查清单](docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md)\n- [完整配置与限制](REFERENCE.md)\n\n[项目主页](https://github.com/jeskoky-pixel/Amadeus-dsh) · [MIT 许可证](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
